kind: virtual
sourceName: mule_geo_legs
sql: "SELECT * FROM mule_geo_legs WHERE SCENE = 'cashout'"
description: "Link Analysis showcase GEO scene - the cash-out legs with both ends geocoded: MULE-HUB-02 (Marseille) funds eight CASHER accounts in metro branches, who all cash out through TILL-06 in Paris; ordinary customers cash out across TILL-01 to TILL-05 in five other cities, so the map shows one converging star against scattered spokes. SYNTHETIC."
